      *******************************************************

       01  ROUTE-LINE                    PIC X(80).
       01  DATA-LINE                     PIC X(80).
       01  DATA-SCREEN REDEFINES DATA-LINE.
           05  DATA-CLASS                PIC X(1).
           05  DATA-DEPT                 PIC X(1).
           05  DATA-ACCT                 PIC X(1).
           05  DATA-ENTRIES              PIC X(30).
           05  DATA-DATE                 PIC X(6).
           05  DATA-PO                   PIC X(1).
