           05  ACCEPT-ALL-FLAG           PIC X(1) VALUE SPACE.
               88  ALL-ITEMS-SELECT               VALUE "A".
           05  ACCEPT-ENTRIES.
               07  ACCEPT-CHOICE OCCURS 5 TIMES INDEXED BY C-I
                                         PIC X(6).
